Third-party material
--------------------

libmpq — GPL-2.0-or-later
    tools/mpq_extract.c is our own code, but it includes <libmpq/mpq.h> and is
    built against the libmpq static library that the AzerothCore build
    produces. The resulting mpq_extract binary is therefore covered by
    GPL-2.0-or-later. The source file in this repository stays MIT.

Lucide — ISC
    The icon shapes in web/js/lib/icons.js are hand-written SVG path data drawn
    in the style of Lucide. No Lucide code or file is copied, included or
    distributed here.

Loaded at runtime from third-party CDNs, never vendored in this repository:

    Leaflet 1.9.4 — BSD-2-Clause
    Cinzel, Inter and Spectral (Google Fonts) — SIL Open Font License 1.1

The combined server binary
--------------------------

AzerothCore links its modules statically. When this module is built into the
worldserver alongside AGPL-3.0 modules, the combined binary is AGPL-3.0, and
anyone who runs that server for other people must offer them its source. The
files in this repository keep their MIT terms.
